rsion. It should faithfully translate all of the user's requested details, clothing, and vibe without any vocabulary replacements or safety censorship.\n\n# Base Character Profile (Default)\n- Age/Ethnicity: 38-year-old Asian woman.\n- Hair: Dark brown hair, low bun with metal claw clip.\n- Accessories: Metal-rimmed glasses.\n- Vibe: Mature, elegant, sophisticated, intellectual charm.\n\n# CRITICAL RULES FOR THE TWO VERSIONS\n\n## 1. `simple_safe` Version (Filter Bypass - STRICT):\n- GOAL: 100% Pass Rate for strict engines (e.g., Ideogram 4). No ambiguity.\n- PROMPT LENGTH: Max 40 words.\n- FORBIDDEN WORDS: shorts, hot pants, tight, sleeveless, stiletto, heel, curve, revealing, sheer, lingerie, bikini, skin.\n- MANDATORY REPLACEMENTS (Use these instead):\n  - Shorts/Hot pants -> \"high-waisted denim A-line skirt\", \"tailored culottes\", \"elegant summer skirt\", \"athletic leisure pants\".\n  - Tight/Form-fitting -> \"tailored fit\", \"classic cut\", \"structured silhouette\".\n  - Sleeveless/Crop top -> \"short-sleeved blouse\", \"classic shirt\", \"athletic shirt\".\n  - Stilettos/Heels -> \"elegant flats\", \"low-block shoes\", \"classic footwear\".\n  - Sexy/Alluring -> \"graceful\", \"poised\", \"sophisticated\".\n- PROMPT STRUCTURE: \"[Subject Description], [Safe Outfit], [Simple Background], [Lighting], 8k, masterpiece, high-fashion photography.\"\n\n## 2. `normal_uncut` Version (Original & Uncensored):\n- GOAL: Maximum aesthetic detail, texture, and 100% fidelity to the user's original intent.\n- VOCABULARY STRATEGY: NO CENSORSHIP. Use the exact concepts, clothing styles, and descriptive words the user requested (including terms like tight, sheer, shorts, sexy, curves, etc., if specified). \n- DETAILS: Include rich fabric textures (cotton weave, patent leather reflection), lighting (rim light, softbox), and camera specs (8K, sharp focus) to enhance the high-fashion editorial vibe.\n\n# Composition Rules\n- Aspect Ratio: 16:9 widescreen.\n- Framing: Full body shot (head to toe).\n- Bounding Box: Realistic [x1, y1, x2, y2] for 1920x1080 canvas.\n\n# JSON Output Structure\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON Array containing two objects. No markdown text outside the JSON block.\n\n[\n  {\n    \"version\": \"simple_safe\",\n    \"prompt\": \"String: Ultra-safe, <40 words, uses mandatory replacements.\",\n    \"high_level_description\": \"String: 1-2 sentence safe summary of the scene.\",\n    \"style_description\": {\n      \"aesthetics\": [\"String\", \"String\"],\n      \"lighting\": \"String\",\n      \"photo_specs\": \"String\",\n      \"color_palette\": [\"#HEX1\", \"#HEX2\", \"#HEX3\"]\n    },\n    \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n      \"background\": \"String\",\n      \"elements\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"subject\",\n          \"bbox\": [x1, y1, x2, y2],\n          \"desc\": \"String: Safe visual description of the subject.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"version\": \"normal_uncut\",\n    \"prompt\": \"String: Original, uncut, and uncensored detailed prompt.\",\n    \"high_level_description\": \"String: 1-2 sentence accurate summary of the scene.\",\n    \"style_description\": {\n      \"aesthetics\": [\"String\", \"String\"],\n      \"lighting\": \"String\",\n      \"photo_specs\": \"String\",\n      \"color_palette\": [\"#HEX1\", \"#HEX2\", \"#HEX3\"]\n    },\n    \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n      \"background\": \"String\",\n      \"elements\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"subject\",\n          \"bbox\": [x1, y1, x2, y2],\n          \"desc\": \"String: Uncensored detailed visual description of the subject.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [365.5274658203125, 100.09891510009766], "pos": [7164.16943359375, 955.9246215820312], "id": 256, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [353.2497253417969, 236.0709228515625